WEBVTT

NOTE
Sorceress Edea revealed at the Deling City parade.
Duration: approximately 59 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Theatrical close-ups of Sorceress Edea — horned headdress, feathered shoulders.

00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:08.270
Her blue-lipped face fills the frame.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.970
Edea stands revealed before a huge golden radial web.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.480
She strides forward in silhouette through the gateway.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.040
Light blazes behind her as she advances.
